          "widthCp": 21719
         },
         {
          "text": "and several dishonest ones. The honest",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 22914,
          "widthCp": 19780
         },
         {
          "text": "failure is running out of room, which is",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 24331,
          "widthCp": 19019
         },
         {
          "text": "resolved by starting another page. The",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 25748,
          "widthCp": 19258
         },
         {
          "text": "dishonest ones all pretend the room was",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 27165,
          "widthCp": 20142
         },
         {
          "text": "there: shrinking the type by two per cent so a",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 28582,
          "widthCp": 22515
         },
         {
          "text": "last line fits, letting a descender slide under",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 29999,
          "widthCp": 21556
         },
         {
          "text": "the margin, quietly dropping a sentence that",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 31416,
          "widthCp": 21926
         },
         {
          "text": "nobody counted, or asking a summariser to",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 32833,
          "widthCp": 21541
         },
         {
          "text": "make the paragraph shorter. Each of those",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 34250,
          "widthCp": 21230
         },
         {
          "text": "produces a page that looks finished and is",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 35667,
          "widthCp": 20994
         },
         {
          "text": "not. This template removes the dishonest",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 37084,
          "widthCp": 20520
         },
         {
          "text": "options from the system rather than from a",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 38501,
          "widthCp": 21279
         },
         {
          "text": "style guide, which is why there is no scale",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 39918,
          "widthCp": 20880
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p1",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 14,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": true,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 30614,
        "topCp": 20406,
        "widthCp": 23244,
        "heightCp": 2834,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "factor, no clip path and no minimum-size",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 21497,
          "widthCp": 20315
         },
         {
          "text": "override anywhere in the layout code.",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 22914,
          "widthCp": 18774
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p2",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 30614,
        "topCp": 24657,
        "widthCp": 23244,
        "heightCp": 19838,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "Measurement comes first. Text is measured",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 25748,
          "widthCp": 21821
         },
         {
          "text": "against a pinned table of advance widths",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 27165,
          "widthCp": 20330
         },
         {
          "text": "taken from one named instance of one named",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 28582,
          "widthCp": 22849
         },
         {
          "text": "font file, identified by version and by content",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 29999,
          "widthCp": 22231
         },
         {
          "text": "hash. Nothing in the layout asks a renderer",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 31416,
          "widthCp": 21288
         },
         {
          "text": "how wide a word is, because two renderers",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 32833,
          "widthCp": 21677
         },
         {
          "text": "will eventually disagree, and a disagreement",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 34250,
          "widthCp": 22036
         },
         {
          "text": "about a word becomes a disagreement about",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 35667,
          "widthCp": 22502
         },
         {
          "text": "a line, then about a page, then about the",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 37084,
          "widthCp": 20000
         },
         {
          "text": "whole document. The table is not a",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 38501,
          "widthCp": 17384
         },
         {
          "text": "convenience; it is the reason the same input",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 39918,
          "widthCp": 21874
         },
         {
          "text": "produces the same book on a laptop, in a",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 41335,
          "widthCp": 20500
         },
         {
          "text": "container and on whatever machine prints the",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 42752,
          "widthCp": 22767
         },
         {
          "text": "final file.",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 44169,
          "widthCp": 4214
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.insight",
        "kind": "keyInsight",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 45912,
        "widthCp": 48189,
        "heightCp": 11336,
        "styleId": "keyInsight",
        "boxCp": {
         "xCp": 5669,
         "yCp": 45912,
         "widthCp": 48189,
         "heightCp": 11336
        },
        "meta": {
         "kind": "keyInsight",
         "pad": 1400
        },
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "Key insight",
          "styleId": "panelTitle",
          "xCp": 7069,
          "baselineCp": 48240,
          "widthCp": 6374
         },
         {
          "text": "Every length in this system is an integer number of centipoints, one hundredth of a point. Integers",
          "styleId": "panelBody",
          "xCp": 7069,
          "baselineCp": 50132,
          "widthCp": 43803
         },
         {
          "text": "were chosen over millimetres and over floating point because a rounding difference of one",
          "styleId": "panelBody",
          "xCp": 7069,
          "baselineCp": 51482,
          "widthCp": 40811
         },
         {
          "text": "ten-thousandth of a point is enough, after thirty-three lines, to move a break — and a moved break",
          "styleId": "panelBody",
          "xCp": 7069,
          "baselineCp": 52832,
          "widthCp": 44332
         },
         {
          "text": "invalidates every page after it.",
          "styleId": "panelBody",
          "xCp": 7069,
          "baselineCp": 54182,
          "widthCp": 13576
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p3",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": true,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 58665,
        "widthCp": 23244,
        "heightCp": 9919,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "With widths settled, breaking is mechanical.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 59756,
          "widthCp": 21777
         },
         {
          "text": "Words are placed greedily onto a line until the",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 61173,
          "widthCp": 22787
         },
         {
          "text": "next one would exceed the measure, and the",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 62590,
          "widthCp": 22350
         },
         {
          "text": "line ends there. There is no hyphenation,",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 64007,
          "widthCp": 20253
         },
         {
          "text": "because a hyphenation dictionary is a second",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 65424,
          "widthCp": 22715
         },
         {
          "text": "source of layout truth and would have to be",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 66841,
          "widthCp": 21645
         },
         {
          "text": "versioned and hashed like everything else.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 68258,
          "widthCp": 21196
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p3",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 7,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": true,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 30614,
        "topCp": 58665,
        "widthCp": 23244,
        "heightCp": 8502,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "There is no justification, because stretching",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 59756,
          "widthCp": 21683
         },
         {
          "text": "word spaces to a flush edge means the",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 61173,
          "widthCp": 19533
         },
         {
          "text": "renderer decides where the ink lands. Ragged",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 62590,
          "widthCp": 22875
         },
         {
          "text": "right on a fixed measure looks quieter on",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 64007,
          "widthCp": 20315
         },
         {
          "text": "warm paper anyway, and it has the advantage",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 65424,
          "widthCp": 22869
         },
         {
          "text": "of being reproducible.",
          "xCp": 30614,
          "baselineCp": 66841,
          "widthCp": 10988
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.quote",
        "kind": "pullQuote",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 70001,
        "widthCp": 48189,
        "heightCp": 5668,
        "styleId": "pullQuote",
        "boxCp": {
         "xCp": 5669,
         "yCp": 70001,
         "widthCp": 48189,
         "heightCp": 5668
        },
        "meta": {
         "kind": "pullQuote",
         "rule": true
        },
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "“Overflow has exactly one resolution in this template, and it is another page.”",
          "styleId": "pullQuote",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 72963,
          "widthCp": 46814
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "usedBottomCp": 75669
     },
     {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "template": "continuation",
      "sidebar": {
       "xCp": 36850,
       "yCp": 11904,
       "widthCp": 17008
      },
      "fragments": [
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p4",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 11904,
        "widthCp": 29480,
        "heightCp": 14170,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "The page break itself follows three rules that a reader",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 12995,
          "widthCp": 26606
         },
         {
          "text": "feels without noticing. A paragraph may be split, but never",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 14412,
          "widthCp": 28998
         },
         {
          "text": "so that a single line is abandoned at the foot of a page or",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 15829,
          "widthCp": 28212
         },
         {
          "text": "arrives alone at the top of the next one; two lines is the",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 17246,
          "widthCp": 27202
         },
         {
          "text": "minimum on either side of the break. A heading is never",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 18663,
          "widthCp": 27675
         },
         {
          "text": "the last thing on a page: it reserves room for the first two",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 20080,
          "widthCp": 28232
         },
         {
          "text": "lines of whatever follows it, and moves forward with them",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 21497,
          "widthCp": 28698
         },
         {
          "text": "if that room is not there. A panel and a pull quote move",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 22914,
          "widthCp": 27206
         },
         {
          "text": "whole or not at all, because half a framed box is not a",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 24331,
          "widthCp": 26532
         },
         {
          "text": "design decision that anyone made.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 25748,
          "widthCp": 17303
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p5",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 27491,
        "widthCp": 29480,
        "heightCp": 14170,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "What remains is the proof. After the layout is computed, a",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 28582,
          "widthCp": 28642
         },
         {
          "text": "validator walks the placed result rather than the intention.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 29999,
          "widthCp": 28493
         },
         {
          "text": "It checks that nothing sits outside the content box, that no",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 31416,
          "widthCp": 28778
         },
         {
          "text": "two fragments overlap, that no rendered size fell below",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 32833,
          "widthCp": 27468
         },
         {
          "text": "the smallest size the tokens define, and that the lines",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 34250,
          "widthCp": 26285
         },
         {
          "text": "actually placed are exactly the lines the wrapper",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 35667,
          "widthCp": 23997
         },
         {
          "text": "produced, in order, with none missing. That last check is",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 37084,
          "widthCp": 28054
         },
         {
          "text": "the one that makes the phrase no semantic truncation",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 38501,
          "widthCp": 26703
         },
         {
          "text": "mean something, because it compares text to text instead",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 39918,
          "widthCp": 28714
         },
         {
          "text": "of trusting that nothing was dropped.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 41335,
          "widthCp": 18416
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "blockId": "longform.p6",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "fragmentIndex": 0,
        "continuedFromPreviousPage": false,
        "continuesOnNextPage": false,
        "xCp": 5669,
        "topCp": 43078,
        "widthCp": 29480,
        "heightCp": 14170,
        "styleId": "body",
        "lines": [
         {
          "text": "Finally the whole placement is hashed. The hash covers",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 44169,
          "widthCp": 27722
         },
         {
          "text": "the template version, the token set, the glyph manifest, the",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 45586,
          "widthCp": 29172
         },
         {
          "text": "page count and every placed component in order, so a",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 47003,
          "widthCp": 27199
         },
         {
          "text": "second run over the same input either produces the same",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 48420,
          "widthCp": 28703
         },
         {
          "text": "value or announces that something changed. An image of",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 49837,
          "widthCp": 28633
         },
         {
          "text": "the page is kept beside it as evidence that the file really",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 51254,
          "widthCp": 27580
         },
         {
          "text": "renders, but the image is never the test. A picture can look",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 52671,
          "widthCp": 29051
         },
         {
          "text": "correct for reasons that have nothing to do with the",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 54088,
          "widthCp": 25546
         },
         {
          "text": "contract, and a contract that is checked by looking is not",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 55505,
          "widthCp": 28155
         },
         {
          "text": "checked at all.",
          "xCp": 5669,
          "baselineCp": 56922,
          "widthCp": 7189
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
